window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I died and was accidentally reborn as an [angelic monstrosity].</b></p> <p>So now I'm building a holy dungeon-tower that is tall enough to reach the gods...so that I can complain about it!</p> <p>But the humans think that I am trying to destroy the world.</p> <p>This is the first volume of the Final Core, a dungeon core base-building LitRPG series.</p>"; 
